//pbs.twimg.com/media/HO9Vzo7WoAAIslH?format=png&name=orig","width":416,"height":464}],"quote":null},{"id":"2084980293526569227","url":"https://x.com/LindaRaschke/status/2084980293526569227","text":"You can see how this positive feedback kicked in in the gold.  85% of the time, markets are in a mean reverting mode, or negative feedback. It's pretty rare to get more than 3-4 days of positive feedback before consolidation or small trading range sets in.","timestampShown":"5:30 AM \u00b7 Aug 5, 2026","timestamp":"2026-08-05T05:30:00","timestampLabel":"Aug 5, 2026 \u00b7 5:30 AM","dateKey":"2026-08-05","tickers":[],"searchText":"you can see how this positive feedback kicked in in the gold.  85% of the time, markets are in a mean reverting mode, or negative feedback. it's pretty rare to get more than 3-4 days of positive feedback before consolidation or small trading range sets in.\n5:30 am \u00b7 aug 5, 2026\naug 5, 2026 \u00b7 5:30 am\n2026-08-05\n","images":[{"src":"images/2084980293526569227_1.png","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO9WKg5W8AAnaKh?format=png&name=orig","width":416,"height":464}],"quote":null},{"id":"2084981046349582684","url":"https://x.com/LindaRaschke/status/2084981046349582684","text":"Sugar: another example of \"positive feedback\" mode...you can see how the lines started to fragment, even tho the trend can continue higher.   We would like this feeling to last forever, but....still have to trade one day at a time!","timestampShown":"5:33 AM \u00b7 Aug 5, 2026","timestamp":"2026-08-05T05:33:00","timestampLabel":"Aug 5, 2026 \u00b7 5:33 AM","dateKey":"2026-08-05","tickers":[],"searchText":"sugar: another example of \"positive feedback\" mode...you can see how the lines started to fragment, even tho the trend can continue higher.   we would like this feeling to last forever, but....still have to trade one day at a time!\n5:33 am \u00b7 aug 5, 2026\naug 5, 2026 \u00b7 5:33 am\n2026-08-05\n","images":[{"src":"images/2084981046349582684_1.png","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO9W4P6XcAADmfJ?format=png&name=orig","width":352,"height":464}],"quote":null},{"id":"2084981832638955537","url":"https://x.com/LindaRaschke/status/2084981832638955537","text":"SP: negative feedback. This is how most markets trade the majority of the time and Taylor Trading Technique excels. I explain a bit more in my Trading Sardines book on how i first used this in the 80s to buy or sell straddles. (book is soon to be released print on demand overseas.)","timestampShown":"5:36 AM \u00b7 Aug 5, 2026","timestamp":"2026-08-05T05:36:00","timestampLabel":"Aug 5, 2026 \u00b7 5:36 AM","dateKey":"2026-08-05","tickers":[],"searchText":"sp: negative feedback. this is how most markets trade the majority of the time and taylor trading technique excels. i explain a bit more in my trading sardines book on how i first used this in the 80s to buy or sell straddles. (book is soon to be released print on demand overseas.)\n5:36 am \u00b7 aug 5, 2026\naug 5, 2026 \u00b7 5:36 am\n2026-08-05\n","images":[{"src":"images/2084981832638955537_1.png","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO9XeD2WAAAhAJW?format=png&name=orig","width":320,"height":464}],"quote":null},{"id":"2084982352086753544","url":"https://x.com/LindaRaschke/status/2084982352086753544","text":"Am trying to share tidbits now cuz I said I would start writing substack notes explaining all I've learned the past 46 years, but 've been recovering from surgery the past month and taking care of senior Mom's affairs on the opposite coast.","timestampShown":"5:38 AM \u00b7 Aug 5, 2026","timestamp":"2026-08-05T05:38:00","timestampLabel":"Aug 5, 2026 \u00b7 5:38 AM","dateKey":"2026-08-05","tickers":[],"searchText":"am trying to share tidbits now cuz i said i would start writing substack notes explaining all i've learned the past 46 years, but 've been recovering from surgery the past month and taking care of senior mom's affairs on the opposite coast.\n5:38 am \u00b7 aug 5, 2026\naug 5, 2026 \u00b7 5